# The capability envelope this task's oracles were written against, recorded
# from the grading host. test.sh asserts every one of these flags is present:
# on a host without AVX2 or BMI2 the dispatchers select nothing, every scored
# row reads ~1.00x, and the task collapses into a measurement of nothing that
# looks exactly like a candidate who did no work.
#
# Recorded from /proc/cpuinfo on the authoring host (Intel Xeon @ 2.20GHz,
# 16 vCPU, 8 cores/socket, 1 socket, 1 NUMA node). AVX-512 is absent, which is
# why the AVX-512 tiers the oracle patches contain are dead code here and are
# not part of the envelope.
required: sse2 avx2 bmi2 popcnt
absent:   avx512f avx512bw avx512vbmi2 avx512vpopcntdq
width:    256
threads:  1
